# Configuration reference / 配置参考

Generated by devkit (kitex-service@{{.ComponentVersion}}). **This file is managed:**
`devkit update` rewrites it, so it always describes the settings supported by
the version your service is on. Your `dev.yaml`, `prod.yaml` and any other
`*.yaml` here are yours and are never rewritten; when a new template version
adds a setting, `devkit update` tells you, and you copy it from here.

由 devkit 生成（kitex-service@{{.ComponentVersion}}）。**本文件由 devkit 管理：**
`devkit update` 会改写它，所以它描述的始终是你的服务当前版本所支持的全部配置项。
本目录下的 `dev.yaml`、`prod.yaml` 以及其他 `*.yaml` 归你所有，永远不会被改写；
模板新版本增加配置项时，`devkit update` 会提示你，你再从这里复制过去。

## How a file is chosen / 加载哪个文件

| | |
|---|---|
| `APP_ENV` | selects `conf/<APP_ENV>.yaml`; default `dev`. 选择 `conf/<APP_ENV>.yaml`，默认 `dev` |
| `CONF_DIR` | directory to read from. Otherwise `./conf`, then `conf` next to the executable. 指定配置目录；未设置时依次查找 `./conf`、可执行文件旁边的 `conf` |
| `${NAME}` | replaced by the environment variable `NAME` before parsing. 解析前替换为环境变量 `NAME` 的值 |

**The Docker image has no `dev.yaml`.** The Dockerfile sets `APP_ENV=prod` and
leaves `dev.yaml` out of the image, so a container whose `APP_ENV` got lost or
overridden refuses to start and names the files there are, instead of running
with the development settings: not registered in Nacos, debug level, console
output. For a development cluster use an environment of its own, e.g.
`test.yaml` with `APP_ENV=test`.

**Docker 镜像里没有 `dev.yaml`。** Dockerfile 设置了 `APP_ENV=prod`，并且不把
`dev.yaml` 放进镜像。这样一来，容器的 `APP_ENV` 如果丢失或被覆盖，服务会拒绝启动并列出
现有的配置文件，而不是悄悄用开发配置运行（不注册到 Nacos、debug 级别、控制台格式）。
开发集群请使用单独的环境，例如 `test.yaml` 加 `APP_ENV=test`。

To add an environment, copy `prod.yaml` to e.g. `test.yaml` and start the
service with `APP_ENV=test`.
要增加一个环境，把 `prod.yaml` 复制为例如 `test.yaml`，启动时设置 `APP_ENV=test`。

## Every setting / 全部配置项

```yaml
service:
  name: {{.Service}}          # registered name; callers use it. 注册名，调用方靠它找到服务
  addr: ":{{.Port}}"            # listen address host:port; empty host = all interfaces. 监听地址，主机留空表示所有网卡

registry_disabled: false  # true = do not register in Nacos (local runs). true 表示不注册到 Nacos（本地开发）

nacos:
  addrs: ["127.0.0.1:8848"]   # Nacos servers host:port, several for a cluster. Nacos 地址，集群写多个
  namespace: ""               # namespace ID, "" = public. 命名空间 ID，"" 为 public
  group: DEFAULT_GROUP        # callers must use the same group. 调用方须使用相同分组
  username: ""                # only with Nacos auth enabled. 仅在 Nacos 开启鉴权时需要
  password: ""
  log_dir: /tmp/nacos/log     # Nacos client log. Nacos 客户端日志目录
  cache_dir: /tmp/nacos/cache # Nacos client cache. Nacos 客户端缓存目录

log:
  level: info                 # debug | info | warn | error
  format: console             # console | json (one JSON object per line). json 为每行一个 JSON 对象
  stacktrace: ""              # level from which records carry the call stack, e.g. error. 从哪个级别起带调用堆栈
  max_field_bytes: 0          # cut longer messages and field values; 0 = no limit. 截断过长的消息和字段值，0 不限制
  sampling:                   # flood protection, off unless first is set. 洪峰保护，设置 first 才生效
    first: 0                  # records per second and message written in full. 同一条日志每秒完整写出的条数
    thereafter: 0             # after that every n-th. 之后每 n 条写 1 条
  buffer:                     # buffered output, off unless size is set. 写缓冲，设置 size 才生效
    size: 0                   # bytes. 字节数
    flush_interval: 1s
  version: ""                 # "version" of every JSON record; default: VCS revision of the build. JSON 日志里的 version，默认取构建时的版本库修订号

log_level_data_id: ""         # Nacos data id whose content is the log level; "" = off. 内容为日志级别的 Nacos 配置，留空关闭

shutdown:
  deregister_wait: 3s         # keep serving this long after leaving Nacos; 0s = off. 注销后继续服务的时长，0s 关闭
  drain_timeout: 15s          # time for in-progress requests to finish. 处理中的请求最多还能执行多久
```

| Setting | Default when omitted / 省略时的默认值 |
|---------|--------------------------------------|
| `service.name` | none, required / 无，必填 |
| `service.addr` | `:8888` |
| `registry_disabled` | `false` |
| `nacos.addrs` | none; required unless `registry_disabled: true` / 无；除非关闭注册，否则必填 |
| `nacos.group` | `DEFAULT_GROUP` |
| `log.level` | `info` |
| `log.format` | `console` (`json: true` of older services is still understood / 旧服务的 `json: true` 仍然有效) |
| `log.stacktrace` | none / 不带堆栈 |
| `log.max_field_bytes` | `0`, no limit / 不限制 |
| `log.sampling` | off / 关闭 |
| `log.buffer` | off / 关闭 |
| `log_level_data_id` | none / 无 |
| `shutdown.deregister_wait` | `3s` |
| `shutdown.drain_timeout` | `15s` |

## Logging: the three production safeguards / 日志：三个生产环境的保护项

`sampling`, `buffer` and `max_field_bytes` are off unless you set them, because
each of them changes what ends up in the log: one leaves records out, one
delays them, one cuts them. The first record of a starting service, `logger
configured`, shows which are in effect. `dev.yaml` sets none of them, since in
development you want every record, at once and in full.

`sampling`、`buffer`、`max_field_bytes` 不配置就是关闭的，因为它们都会改变最终写进日志的
内容：一个会丢记录，一个会延迟输出，一个会截断内容。服务启动时的第一条日志
`logger configured` 会显示哪些正在生效。`dev.yaml` 三项都不设置，因为开发时你需要
每一条日志都立即、完整地出现。

| | What it does / 作用 | What it costs / 代价 | `prod.yaml` |
|---|---|---|---|
| `sampling` | within a second, identical records are written `first` times, then every `thereafter`-th. 一秒内相同的日志先写 `first` 条，之后每 `thereafter` 条写 1 条 | records are left out; how many is reported. 会丢日志；丢了多少会有记录 | **on / 开** |
| `max_field_bytes` | cuts a longer message or field value and says how long it was. 截断过长的消息或字段值，并注明原长度 | the rest of that value is gone. 该值的剩余部分看不到 | **on / 开**, 8192 |
| `buffer` | collects output in memory and writes it in larger pieces. 先在内存里攒一批再写出 | the last `flush_interval` is lost when the process dies abnormally. 进程异常死亡时丢失最后一个 `flush_interval` 内的日志 | **off / 关** |

### sampling

It protects the disk and the log collector from a flood: when Redis is down,
every request logs the same error, tens of thousands of times a second, and
they all say the same. Records count as identical when level and **message**
are the same; fields do not count. So `zlog.Error("redis down", zlog.Int("uid",
uid))` is sampled as one message, while `zlog.Errorf("redis down for %d", uid)`
is a different message each time and is hardly sampled at all: one more reason
to put values into fields.

Nothing is dropped without a trace. For every second with drops there is one
record per level and message, at the level of what was dropped:

```
ERROR zlog: records dropped by sampling dropped_msg="redis down" dropped=4213
```

它保护磁盘和日志采集系统不被洪峰打爆：Redis 挂掉时，每个请求都打同一条错误，每秒几万条，
内容完全一样。“相同的日志”按级别和**消息文字**判断，字段不算。所以
`zlog.Error("redis down", zlog.Int("uid", uid))` 会被当作同一条消息来采样；而
`zlog.Errorf("redis down for %d", uid)` 每条的文字都不同，采样对它基本无效。
这也是应该把值放进字段的又一个理由。

被丢弃的日志不会无声无息地消失：凡是发生了丢弃的那一秒，都会按级别和消息各补一条记录
（见上面的示例），级别与被丢弃的日志相同。

### max_field_bytes

A record is one line. Container runtimes split lines of more than 16 KB, and a
collector that gets the pieces no longer sees a JSON object: the record is
lost. The usual cause is `zlog.Any("resp", resp)` with a large value. The limit
is **per value**, not per record, which is why the template sets 8192 and not
16000: it leaves room for the other fields, but a record with several values
near the limit can still exceed 16 KB. Stack traces are not cut.

一条日志就是一行。容器运行时会把超过 16KB 的行拆开，采集系统拿到的碎片不再是一个 JSON
对象，这条日志就丢了。常见的原因是 `zlog.Any("resp", resp)` 打出了一个很大的值。这个上限是
针对**单个值**的，不是针对整条日志，所以模板设的是 8192 而不是 16000：给其他字段留出余量。
但如果一条日志里有好几个接近上限的值，整行仍然可能超过 16KB。堆栈不会被截断。

### buffer: when to turn it on / 什么时候该打开

**Leave it off unless both of these are true / 除非同时满足下面两条，否则保持关闭：**

1. The service logs a lot, roughly **tens of thousands of records a second**,
   and a CPU profile shows writing the log as a real share of the CPU.
   服务的日志量很大，大致在**每秒几万条以上**，并且从 CPU 性能分析里能看到写日志占了可观的比例。
2. You accept losing the last moment of the log when the process dies
   abnormally. 你能接受进程异常死亡时丢失最后一小段日志。

Why the bar is that high: buffering saves one system call per record, about
**1 to 2 microseconds** (measured with stdout as a pipe, as in a container).

为什么门槛这么高：buffer 省掉的是每条日志的一次系统调用，大约 **1 到 2 微秒**
（按容器里的真实情况测量：stdout 是一个管道）。

| Records per second / 每秒日志条数 | CPU spent writing, unbuffered / 不开 buffer 时写日志占用的 CPU | Saved by buffering / 开 buffer 省下 |
|---|---|---|
| 1 000 (most services / 多数业务服务) | about 0.3 % of one core / 约一个核的 0.3% | about 0.2 % |
| 10 000 | about 3 % | about 2 % |
| 100 000 (gateways, battle servers / 网关、战斗服) | about 27 % | about 19 %: now it pays / 这时才值得 |

What it costs. Records wait in memory for up to `flush_interval`.

- **Not lost**: a normal stop (SIGTERM, Ctrl+C; `kitexx.Run` flushes before it
  returns), a `zlog.Fatal`, a `zlog.Sync()`.
- **Lost**: whatever was still in memory when the process is killed for using
  too much memory, by `kill -9` or the platform's kill timeout, or by a panic
  or a fatal runtime error nobody recovered.

The second list is exactly when the last second of the log is what you need: it
says what the process was doing when it died. That is why the template turns
`sampling` on and `buffer` off, although both are for production: sampling only
acts in an emergency and tells you what it left out, whereas buffering is a
performance optimization that costs a little all the time and shows its price
at the worst moment.

代价：日志会在内存里最多停留 `flush_interval` 这么久。

- **不会丢**：正常退出（SIGTERM、Ctrl+C，`kitexx.Run` 返回前会刷出）、`zlog.Fatal`、`zlog.Sync()`。
- **会丢**：进程因为内存超限被杀、`kill -9`、部署平台的强杀超时、没有被捕获的 panic
  或运行时致命错误。此时还留在内存里的日志都会丢失。

会丢的这几种情况，恰恰是最需要最后一秒日志的时候：它能说明进程死之前在做什么。这就是为什么
同样是生产环境的保护项，模板打开了 `sampling` 却关着 `buffer`：采样只在出事时才起作用，
而且会告诉你它丢了多少；buffer 则是一项性能优化，它的代价平时看不出来，到最糟糕的时刻才显现。

When you do turn it on, use a short interval. Under a high volume the buffer
is flushed because it is full, not because of the timer, so a short interval
costs almost nothing and bounds what can be lost:

确定要打开时，把间隔设短。日志量大的时候，缓冲区主要是因为写满才刷出的，而不是靠定时，
所以缩短间隔几乎没有额外开销，却能限制最多会丢多少：

```yaml
log:
  buffer:
    size: 262144          # 256 KB
    flush_interval: 200ms # at most 0.2 s of records can be lost. 最多丢失 0.2 秒的日志
```

## Graceful stop / 优雅退出

On SIGINT or SIGTERM the service: (1) deregisters from Nacos, (2) keeps serving
for `deregister_wait` so callers refresh their instance lists, (3) closes the
listener and lets requests in progress finish for up to `drain_timeout`,
(4) runs the `kitexx.OnShutdown` hooks. Keep `deregister_wait + drain_timeout`
below the platform's kill timeout (Kubernetes: 30s by default).

收到 SIGINT 或 SIGTERM 后，服务会：（1）从 Nacos 注销；（2）继续服务
`deregister_wait`，让调用方刷新实例列表；（3）关闭监听，等待处理中的请求完成，
最多 `drain_timeout`；（4）执行 `kitexx.OnShutdown` 注册的钩子。
`deregister_wait + drain_timeout` 要小于部署平台的强杀超时（Kubernetes 默认 30 秒）。

## Your own settings / 增加你自己的配置

Add a section to the YAML and a field to `Config` in **`app/app.go`**. That
file is yours; `cmd/{{.Service}}/main.go` belongs to the framework and must not
be edited, otherwise it can no longer be updated.

在 YAML 里加一节，并在 **`app/app.go`** 的 `Config` 里加一个字段。这个文件归你所有；
`cmd/{{.Service}}/main.go` 属于框架，不要修改它，否则它就无法再被升级。

```go
// app/app.go
type Config struct {
	kitexx.Config `yaml:",inline"`
	Redis redisx.Config `yaml:"redis"`
}
```

```yaml
redis:
  addr: "${REDIS_ADDR}"
  password: "${REDIS_PASSWORD}"
```

Then create the dependency in `app.Setup` and register its cleanup there:
然后在 `app.Setup` 里创建这个依赖，并在那里注册它的清理动作：

```go
// app/app.go
func Setup(cfg *Config) (*handler.{{.Service | title}}ServiceImpl, error) {
	rdb, err := redisx.New(context.Background(), cfg.Redis)
	if err != nil {
		return nil, err
	}
	kitexx.OnShutdown("redis", rdb.Close)
	return handler.New(rdb), nil
}
```
